    <meta name="description" content="
     A microporous polyolefin membrane comprising a polyethylene resin, and polypropylene having a weight-average molecular weight of 6×10 5  or more and a heat of fusion of 90 J/g or more (measured by a differential scanning calorimeter), a fraction having a molecular weight of 5×10 4  or less being 5% or less by mass of the polypropylene.  
   
   ">
