      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the microporous polyolefin membranes of Examples 1-10</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">had well-balanced air permeability, porosity, prick resistance, dimensional stability, and meltdown properties.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0150">
      </li>
